{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、ついに勉強机を捨てました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母と祖母に買ってもらったものだし、\n安いものではないから\nなんとなく捨てるのを\n戸惑ってしまっていたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう買ってから17年経つので\n流石にいいかな〜〜っと、\n思いきって捨てました(T_T)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強机に何気なく入っていた文房具も\n必要最低限のもの以外は捨てて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使えるものは受験生のザキさんに\nあげましたo(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未練がないわけではないですが\n凄くスッキリo(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までありがとう。\n私の学生時代の全てが詰まった机、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"断捨離にハマりそう...！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mステ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだの金曜日は人生初の\nミュージックステーションに出演させて\n頂きました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感無量！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村さんポジは初めてということで\nリハの時からとても緊張していて\n大丈夫大丈夫と何度も言い聞かせても\nやっぱり緊張しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくれた方はどうだったかな、、、？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46の歌をもっとたくさんの方に\n聞いてもらうために頑張ったつもりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のシングルは選抜なので、\nまた太陽ノックでも呼んでもらえたら\nいいのにな〜〜(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11th個別握手会@名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6/13は11枚目最後の握手会でした(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花柄のワンピース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペプラムサマーニット\nスキニー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に11枚目の期間では\nいろんなことがあって\n話をたくさん出来て楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔は活動も少なくて話す内容も\nなかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はありがたいことに\n活動の幅も広がっていろんな話が\n出来ていて本当に嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真面目な話から他愛のない話\n勇気付けてくれたり、\n夢の話をしてくれたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな会話が出来るから握手会は\n本当に自分のエネルギーになります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12枚目はまた枠数が増えて\nとても不安ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけ皆さんと会える時間が増える！\nとポジティブにとらえ頑張ります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12枚目もいろんな思い出を\n作りましょう〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お返事time"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーヒーはブラック飲める？？？\n(タイガース鳥谷さん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飲めます！\n甘いものをたくさん食べるので、\nブラック率は結構高め(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的にはチョコレートスコーンと\nアイスコーヒーの組み合わせが好きすぎる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビアガーデン一行った？？？\n(貫禅寺 藍さん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ行ったことないので、\n行ってみたいですね(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんも初森ベマーズ出るの？\n(ダイチョフさん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょこっと出ます〜〜(*^_^*)\nお楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初森ベマーズはみんな名前が\n変わっていますが、\n私の名前が何か予想してみてね♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと当たらないと思う！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"膝大丈夫？？？\n(たくさんの方々より)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫です！\n違和感があるだけなのでo(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストレッチたくさんしなきゃ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！\nいつもたくさんコメントありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎6/24 テレ東 音楽祭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"事前収録してきました(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ\nTVでは初披露かな？？\n是非お見逃しなく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎6/27 TBS 音楽の日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送です！\n生放送はやっぱり緊張しそう...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎毎週水曜 24:00〜\nbayFM まいちゅんカフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！そうそう\n女の子用ブログは思ってたより\n希望が多かった(嬉しい(T_T)！)ので\n改めて書きますね♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参考になるかわからないけど、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問も募集してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/22/8165996/0007.gif","alt":""}